        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ikiwa kuna ugomvi kati ya watu wawili, wakaenda kuamuliwa mahakamani, mmoja akaonekana hana hatia, na mwingine akahukumiwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kama yule aliyehukumiwa amepewa adhabu ya kuchapwa viboko, hakimu atamwamuru huyo alale chini na kuchapwa viboko kulingana na kosa lake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye hatia anaweza kuchapwa viboko arubaini lakini si zaidi. Mkizidisha kiasi hicho mtakuwa mmemfedhehesha ndugu yenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Usimfunge ng'ombe kinywa anapopura nafaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kama ndugu wawili wa kiume wanaishi mahali fulani na mmoja wao akafariki bila kuacha mtoto wa kiume, mkewe marehemu asiolewe na mtu mwingine nje ya jamaa hiyo. Ni wajibu wa ndugu wa marehemu kumwoa mjane huyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtoto wa kwanza wa kiume atakayezaliwa nao atahesabiwa kuwa mtoto wa marehemu, ili jina lake lisifutwe nchini Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini kama huyo ndugu wa marehemu hamtaki huyo mwanamke mjane, basi, mwanamke huyo atakwenda mbele ya wazee wa mji na kusema, ‘Kaka wa mume wangu marehemu anakataa kuendeleza jina la kaka yake marehemu katika Israeli; hapendi kunitimizia jukumu lake la kaka wa mume wangu marehemu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha wazee wa mji watamwita huyo mwanamume kuongea naye. Kama bado atasisitiza kwamba hataki kumwoa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "huyo mwanamke mjane atamwendea mbele ya hao wazee wa mji, atamvua kiatu chake kimoja na kumtemea mate usoni na kumwambia, ‘Hivi ndivyo anavyopaswa kutendewa mtu anayekataa kuidumisha nyumba ya kaka yake.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na jina la nyumba yake katika Israeli litakuwa: ‘Nyumba ya mtu aliyevuliwa kiatu.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wanaume wawili wakipigana na mke wa mmoja wao akamsaidia mumewe kwa kumkamata sehemu za siri yule anayepigana na mumewe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mtaukata mkono wa kulia wa huyo mwanamke; msimhurumie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Msiwe na vipimo vya kupimia vya namna mbili: Kimoja kizito na kingine chepesi. Msitumie mizani za udanganyifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wala msiwe na aina mbili za vipimo vya kupimia, kubwa na ndogo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tumieni mizani na vipimo vyenye uzito sahihi ili mpate kuishi maisha marefu katika nchi anayowapa Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wote wanaofanya mambo hayo, wote wanaotenda kwa udanganyifu ni chukizo kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kumbukeni kitendo cha Waamaleki mlipokuwa safarini kutoka Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumbukeni walivyowashambulieni huko njiani mkiwa wanyonge na kuwapiga wale wote waliokuja nyuma yenu wamechoka. Waamaleki hawakumwogopa Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo wakati Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, atakapowapumzisha kutokana na mashambulio ya adui zenu wote wanaowazunguka katika nchi ambayo amewapa mwimiliki na kuishi humo, ni lazima muwaangamize Waamaleki wote.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
